WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=rw.

1
00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:09.680
Iyi videwo yerekana uburyo bwo gukora imbere yisuzuma ryamaso ukoresheje

2
00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:13.900
igice cyimbere cyibikoresho bya Arclight.

3
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:17.406
Tangira ufite isuku y'intoki kandi wimenyekanishe wenyine.

4
00:00:17.406 --> 00:00:24.920
Emeza umwirondoro wumurwayi, usobanure ikizamini, kandi wemererwe kubikora.

5
00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:29.470
Mubanze fata amasegonda make kugirango witegereze amaso yombi icyarimwe.

6
00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:31.920
Reba kuri periorbitor, ijisho n'amaso.

7
00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:38.160
Gutanga ibisobanuro kubyimba ibyo aribyo byose kubyimba, gutukura no gusohoka, kimwe no kugaragara kwamaso cyangwa bidasanzwe

8
00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:40.680
Umwanya w'amaso.

9
00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:43.608
Noneho kora ikizamini kinini ukoresheje urumuri rwa arc.

10
00:00:43.608 --> 00:00:45.560
Koresha urumuri rwera kandi

11
00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:47.679
fata igikoresho hafi yijisho ryawe.

12
00:00:47.679 --> 00:00:50.100
Buhoro buhoro wegera ijisho ryiburyo ryumurwayi ubanza kugeza

13
00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.220
ni murwego rwo kwibandaho.

14
00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:52.900
Ibi bizaba nka 6cm.

15
00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:55.420
Nkumurwayi kwimura ijisho hanze kandi

16
00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:58.749
imbere, hanyuma hejuru no hepfo, mugihe ufashe buhoro buhoro.

17
00:00:58.749 --> 00:01:00.080
Gutondekanya muburyo butandukanye

18
00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:02.675
imiterere igaragara, ibatekereza mumatsinda.

19
00:01:02.675 --> 00:01:05.640
Itsinda rya mbere ririmo hejuru no hepfo

20
00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:08.432
ingohe hamwe nipfundikizo.

21
00:01:08.432 --> 00:01:16.110
Iya kabiri irimo conjunctiva na sclera hamwe na forenicks yo hepfo.

22
00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:20.425
Itsinda rya gatatu ni cornea, ihuriro ryibi na sclera yitwa

23
00:01:20.425 --> 00:01:21.350
limbis na

24
00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:23.579
imboni y'ijisho, akikijwe na iris.

25
00:01:23.579 --> 00:01:26.550
Umaze kurangiza kubona izo nzego zose, ubu

26
00:01:26.550 --> 00:01:29.190
Noneho hitamo itara ry'ubururu kumuri arc.

27
00:01:29.190 --> 00:01:34.310
Hamwe n'irangi rya fluorescing, firime y'amarira, ahantu ho gutakaza epiteliyale n'indwara bizagaragazwa.

28
00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:37.270
Irangi rya fluoresces ryaka cyane hamwe nubururu bwubururu.

29
00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:42.430
Andika ku gishushanyo kureba n'ubunini bw'ahantu ho gutakaza epiteliyale n'indwara.

30
00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:45.410
Kurangiza usuzume isahani isumba iyindi.

31
00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:50.030
Shira ipamba kumupfundikizo yo hejuru, hanyuma uzamure buhoro buhoro inkoni hejuru mugihe gahoro

32
00:01:50.030 --> 00:01:52.550
gukanda hepfo hamwe na bud.

33
00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:57.562
kwitegereza nijisho ryonyine, hanyuma uzane urumuri rwa arc kugirango ubone ibintu binini.

34
00:01:57.562 --> 00:01:58.230
Subiramo ibi

35
00:01:58.230 --> 00:02:00.130
kwisuzumisha ku rindi jisho.

36
00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:03.550
Nyuma, shimira umurwayi, vuga muri make kandi wandike ibyo wabonye

37
00:02:03.550 --> 00:02:04.614
kandi usubiremo isuku y'intoki.

38
00:02:04.614 --> 00:02:08.070
Nyamuneka reba izindi kaminuza zacu za St Andrews Arc Umucyo

39
00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:08.990
Amashusho yumushinga.
